<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Alex. Brown cuts Sun Micro.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Alex. Brown cuts Sun Micro.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Alex. Brown said its computer systems analyst Phil Rueppel cut his rating on Sun Microsystems Inc to buy from strong buy.</p>
<p>-- The analyst was attending the brokerage's technology conference in Baltimore and was not immediately avaiable to comment.</p>
<p>-- E. Auchard, Wall Street bureau, 212-859-1736</p>
